1
00:00:04,487 --> 00:00:06,752
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,752 --> 00:00:08,882
Metal Cardbot, Setup!

3
00:00:10,282 --> 00:00:13,322
{Jun} Hey, guys! I'm Jun.

4
00:00:13,322 --> 00:00:14,659
{Jun} Now that you're all here,

5
00:00:14,659 --> 00:00:16,597
{Jun} let's watch an episode of Metal Cardbot together!

6
00:00:16,597 --> 00:00:19,492
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

7
00:00:19,492 --> 00:00:21,368
Blue Cop, setup!

8
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,094
{Blue Cop} My name is Blue Cop!

9
00:00:24,094 --> 00:00:27,487
{Blue Cop} It's nice to meet so many new friends, isn't it?

10
00:00:27,487 --> 00:00:29,622
{Jun} Just like it was great meeting you, Blue Cop!

11
00:00:29,622 --> 00:00:31,881
{Jun} How about today we watch the story

12
00:00:31,881 --> 00:00:34,741
{Jun} of how Blue Cop and I first met?

13
00:00:34,741 --> 00:00:36,902
{Jun} Shall we get started?

14
00:00:37,802 --> 00:00:40,848
A... robot?

15
00:00:40,848 --> 00:00:42,873
This ends now, Mega Trucker!

16
00:00:42,873 --> 00:00:44,527
You're coming with me.

17
00:00:48,645 --> 00:00:51,858
Do you really think anyone would just play along nicely when asked something like that?!

18
00:00:55,444 --> 00:00:57,577
{Jun} Haha! Blue Cop!

19
00:00:57,577 --> 00:01:00,509
{Jun} Did you really fall over that hard just by being hit with a tire?

20
00:01:00,509 --> 00:01:03,955
{Blue Cop} Ah... I let my guard down for only a moment, Jun.

21
00:01:03,955 --> 00:01:06,982
{Jun} Blue cop is~ So clumsy~

22
00:01:06,982 --> 00:01:10,208
{Jun} He tripped and~ fell over a tire!~

23
00:01:10,208 --> 00:01:11,919
{Blue Cop} Ngh. Jun!

24
00:01:11,919 --> 00:01:15,630
{Blue Cop} I... I'm not that weak!

25
00:01:21,581 --> 00:01:22,892
There's a human here!

26
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:28,529
Tch. This isn't over!

27
00:01:31,536 --> 00:01:32,392
Stop right there!

28
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:41,602
What have you done to my bike!!

29
00:01:41,602 --> 00:01:43,511
And where did my helmet go?

30
00:01:53,377 --> 00:01:54,901
This doesn't show us anything...

31
00:01:54,901 --> 00:01:56,935
Yeah, didn't even get the license plate.

32
00:01:56,935 --> 00:01:59,627
It would be nice to know the license plate for the police car-

33
00:01:59,627 --> 00:02:02,575
And what would you do with that? Would you go to the police station and ask,

34
00:02:02,575 --> 00:02:05,105
"Is there a car here that transforms into a robot?"

35
00:02:05,705 --> 00:02:07,263
{Jun} Hey, Blue Cop!

36
00:02:07,263 --> 00:02:10,682
{Jun} Where were you hiding before you met me?

37
00:02:10,682 --> 00:02:12,144
{Blue Cop} Well, naturally...

38
00:02:12,144 --> 00:02:14,607
{Blue Cop} I was living in hiding at the police station.

39
00:02:14,607 --> 00:02:17,858
{Jun} Were you really hiding among the police cars?

40
00:02:17,858 --> 00:02:18,807
I picked it up after all of that happened.

41
00:02:18,807 --> 00:02:20,668
Did the robots leave it behind?

42
00:02:20,668 --> 00:02:22,211
I think so.

43
00:02:22,211 --> 00:02:25,479
This looks like something you can buy anywhere these days.

44
00:02:33,918 --> 00:02:35,232
Stop messing around...

45
00:02:35,232 --> 00:02:39,079
Agh, I'm not! I really can't lift it! It's like it's glued to the table!

46
00:02:40,896 --> 00:02:42,174
Let me try.

47
00:02:44,904 --> 00:02:46,636
I can't move it at all, not even an inch!

48
00:02:46,636 --> 00:02:49,463
Don't be ridiculous. See?

49
00:02:49,463 --> 00:02:51,533
- Agh!
- What's going on here?!

50
00:02:51,533 --> 00:02:53,642
That's what I should be asking you guys...

51
00:02:54,408 --> 00:02:55,341
Back off!

52
00:02:55,802 --> 00:02:56,819
J-Jun?

53
00:02:57,156 --> 00:02:59,244
So you want to play the hero?

54
00:02:59,244 --> 00:03:00,891
How's the robot hunt going?

55
00:03:00,891 --> 00:03:02,083
I'll find it soon!

56
00:03:02,083 --> 00:03:04,145
You sound confident!

57
00:03:09,166 --> 00:03:10,405
I stepped in poop.

58
00:03:11,031 --> 00:03:13,165
Rapid fire poop kick!!

59
00:03:13,165 --> 00:03:14,653
Get away, get away!

60
00:03:16,027 --> 00:03:18,621
Vance! How dare you! Aah!

61
00:03:20,083 --> 00:03:21,073
{Blue Cop} Jun!

62
00:03:21,073 --> 00:03:23,063
{Blue Cop} You... you stepped in poop?

63
00:03:23,063 --> 00:03:26,140
{Blue Cop} You shouldn't do that to your friends with shoes you stepped in poop with!

64
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:27,543
{Jun} N-no way!

65
00:03:27,543 --> 00:03:29,547
{Jun} I didn't actually step in poop!

66
00:03:29,547 --> 00:03:31,182
{Blue Cop} It's okay, Jun.

67
00:03:31,182 --> 00:03:33,218
{Blue Cop} You don't have to hide it from me.

68
00:03:33,218 --> 00:03:35,429
{Blue Cop} Besides, something still smells...

69
00:03:35,429 --> 00:03:37,688
{Jun} No! I didn't step in poop-!

70
00:03:37,688 --> 00:03:39,619
{Jun} Uh... Wait a second.

71
00:03:39,619 --> 00:03:42,349
{Jun} You can smell?

72
00:03:42,449 --> 00:03:43,961
Not good!

73
00:03:47,704 --> 00:03:49,363
Nice try!

74
00:03:49,363 --> 00:03:51,484
Nowhere to run now!

75
00:03:52,005 --> 00:03:54,706
Hang on! Let's not resort to violence, you guys!

76
00:03:55,706 --> 00:03:57,313
I said, stop it!

77
00:04:23,959 --> 00:04:24,975
What's going on?

78
00:04:24,975 --> 00:04:26,391
What are you trying to pull now?

79
00:04:27,635 --> 00:04:28,426
Change!

80
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:37,883
Is that... the robot?

81
00:04:43,857 --> 00:04:44,775
{Jun} Blue Cop!

82
00:04:44,775 --> 00:04:47,292
{Jun} I was really surprised when you grabbed me out of nowhere like that!

83
00:04:47,292 --> 00:04:48,604
{Blue Cop} I'm sorry, Jun.

84
00:04:48,604 --> 00:04:51,027
{Blue Cop} In my haste, I wasn't being careful.

85
00:04:51,027 --> 00:04:52,568
{Jun} It was really...

86
00:04:52,568 --> 00:04:56,473
{Jun} So much fun! Let's do it again sometime!

87
00:04:56,473 --> 00:04:58,336
{Blue Cop} You mean... you're not angry, Jun?

88
00:04:58,336 --> 00:05:00,020
{Jun} Angry?

89
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,704
{Jun} I felt like I was flying!

90
00:05:02,704 --> 00:05:04,590
{Blue Cop} Ha... haha! 

91
00:05:04,590 --> 00:05:06,477
{Blue Cop} Then let's go do it again!

92
00:05:06,477 --> 00:05:10,704
My BMX that your friend crushed! You'll need to compensate me for that!

93
00:05:10,704 --> 00:05:11,975
What?!

94
00:05:14,690 --> 00:05:16,478
{Jun} So what do you think, guys?

95
00:05:16,478 --> 00:05:20,684
{Jun} This is how the story of Blue Cop and I met!

96
00:05:20,684 --> 00:05:23,000
{Jun} Let's see each other again next time,

00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:27,101
{Jun} for the next episode of "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!
